        "publisheddescription": "Water service and main transfers on W 49th Ave. between Columbia St. and Cambie St. Water main on north side of W 49th Ave. is being abandoned and so approx. 13 services and one main need to be transferred to the existing main on the south side of W 49th Ave. (within the sidewalk). \r\n\r\nThe work is tentatively planned to take place in late 2026 but may be pushed to an early 2027 start pending operational needs and development schedules. Schedule included in Planit is a window for construction, the construction duration is expected to be less than 2 months. \r\n\r\ninetnion is to complete this work in 2 halves requiring a crossover of traffic on both sides of W 49th Ave. ",
